  title: Tutorial
  image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8a30f7041ca6df44f9f6a6cafc1f798f, type: 3}
  description: '<b>Tutorial</b>


    The Tutorial system stores useful information
    gathered during exploration and continues to research new technologies and discoveries.


    It
    contains exploration records, resource information, creature data, upgrade details,
    and other important knowledge required for progression.


    You can access
    all stored information from the Main Hub. During exploration levels, only a limited
    amount of information may be available depending on the level.


    As you progress
    further, new information and tutorials will gradually become unlocked.'
  isImageBig: 0
